<title>USA: Sulzer Medica overallotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Sulzer Medica overallotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co said on Monday that it and SBC Warburg exercised in full the overallotment option on Sulzer Medica Ltd's initial public offering.</p>
<p>Exercising the overallotment increased the number of Sulzer shares in the offering to 2.6 million from 2.3 million, Morgan Stanley said in a news release.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley is global co-coordinator for the offering. SBC Warburg is co-global co-coordinator.</p>
</text>
